# Away from home: the home's editing keys rest (L-108: Ctrl+Z once removed a piece unseen, and
# I armed the eyedropper for the way home), and natural rain over the Forum is rain where the
# camera looks (L-107: the title card never said so away), and snow only where it snows.
set unlock all
place lamp @30,30
expect count lamp 1
expect undo yes
set season spring
set weather natural
set world forum 1
wait 30
expect away yes
key ctrl+z
wait 3
expect count lamp 1
expect undo yes
key i
wait 2
expect pipette no
fast 3600 raining yes
# What falls is what the interface says (V6-014): winter rain over Babylon is rain, over the
# Zagros snow.
set season winter
set weather rain
set world district:babylon/east_bank 1
wait 20
expect raining yes
expect snowing no
set world district:zagros/land 1
wait 20
expect raining yes
expect snowing yes
quit
